id: pm-todos-release-caller-rollout
title: Adopt the released reusable Daily Release caller
description: "Fleet rollout for unbraind/pm-ops#272 after the successful pm-jira cross-repository OIDC pilot. Replace copied release orchestration with the released SHA caller, matching validator, explicit empty changelog hooks and package-owned caller contracts. No merge, dispatch or publication."
type: Task
status: in_progress
priority: 2
tags[2]: "area:release","gh:unbraind/pm-ops#272"
created_at: "2026-11-14T21:25:02.643Z"
updated_at: "2026-11-16T11:09:34.177Z"
author: codex-ops272-1114
comments[8]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-11-14T21:25:05.631Z",codex-ops272-1114,"Orient and start the authorized fleet rollout. Verified released v2026.11.14 at 7687a35d7522482bd8361d60dbc2589e9afbc81c. Preserve this package approval, schedule, preparation and publication hooks through canonical inputs. The merged Jira pilot proves cross-repository npm identity acceptance; this package must still pass its own first-run preflight. Run caller contracts, installed attestation, strict YAML, actionlint and regenerated changelog checks. Shared-runner hold gates every push. No review-thread action, merge, dispatch or publication."
  "2026-11-14T21:29:00.072Z",codex-ops272-1114,"Rolled the Jira pilot contract into this package: released workflow pin 7687a35d7522482bd8361d60dbc2589e9afbc81c (v2026.11.14), exact pm-ops 2026.11.14 validator, explicit include-empty changelog generation/check/notes hooks, and declared yaml for caller tests. Preserved package-owned approval, schedule and preparation inputs. Focused gates passed 46/46, zero failures/skips; linked caller test passed 6/6 in a scratch pm project to avoid tracker run artifacts. Reverting only release.yml to the old copy in a disposable fixture failed 5 of 6 contracts. Actionlint passed 1/1, strict workflow/Dependabot YAML parsing 2/2, installed publish-attestation passed 1/1. Regenerate changelog and check after this final tracker write. Full npm/Bun certification remains with CI; no full local pass is claimed. Cross-repository npm OIDC evidence is Jira run 43639146392, recorded on pm-ops#272; first package activation must still pass its preflight. Every push waits on the shared-runner hold. No merge, dispatch, publication or review-thread action. Leave this item open and release only this author claim."
  "2026-11-15T02:48:42.735Z",codex-ops272-1114,"Round 2 CI follow-up: canonical tag lookup can return unverified-offline. The old inline-publisher success-message assertion then fails despite a valid caller. Update the package attestation test to assert structured recognition, require an explicit deferral without an attestation claim offline, and preserve all refusal checks. Prove it with forced offline execution in a disposable Git fixture; keep coverage source inventory and thresholds unchanged."
  "2026-11-15T03:08:56.910Z",codex-ops272-1114,"Round 2 attestation follow-up: targeted tests passed 14/14, including the retained caller and package behavior contracts. Forced offline verification explicitly reports unverified-offline and defers attestation; it never claims verified provenance. In a disposable Git fixture, the fixed assertion passes, reverting only to the old assertion fails, and restoring the fix passes. Unattested-publish refusal checks remain intact. Typecheck passed; coverage source inventory and thresholds remain unchanged. Linked tests passed in a copied scratch tracker. Regenerate and check the changelog after this final write. Exact pushed-head npm/Bun coverage and release certification remain CI gates. No merge, release dispatch, publication or review-thread action."
  "2026-11-16T09:28:51.541Z",pi-claude,"Stalled-PR recovery. The only failing check was the Greptile thread on the attestation test: the offline-deferral assertions ran only when CI's own tag lookup happened to fail, so a runner with network skipped the exact deferral behavior the change protects. Added a deterministic forced-offline regression that sets the canonical auditor's documented offline switch, asserts the deferral message, a zero exit code, no manufactured failures and no attestation claim, and restores the environment. The conditional checkout-level test is kept unchanged. Suite passes 9/9 locally after the merge from main."
  "2026-11-16T10:41:17.947Z",codex-sol,"Continuation verified clean local and remote head 699f59a; current Node floor and Node 26 CI and Greptile pass. No unresolved threads remain. Keep the forced-offline attestation proof from 699f59a and re-run quick package, caller, changelog and release gates without changing the caller contract."
  "2026-11-16T11:08:49.172Z",codex-sol,"Retained 699f59a and verified that the offline-coverage review finding is already addressed by an unconditional forced-offline proof. No unresolved review threads remain. Focused release-workflow and attestation suites pass 15/15; linked caller contracts pass 6/6 after acknowledging their inspected provenance on this branch. Typecheck and changelog generation pass; no lint script is configured. The full quick npm suite and generated changelog check remain active under severe shared-host load, so no complete npm or release-check pass is claimed. The prior release-check attempt was stopped to avoid duplicating the full suite; certification remains an exact-head CI gate. No source behavior or thresholds changed, and no review-thread, merge, dispatch or publication action was taken."
  "2026-11-16T11:09:34.176Z",codex-sol,The generated changelog check has now completed successfully. Caller and attestation source remains unchanged from 699f59a; only continuation evidence and inspected linked-test provenance were updated.
